{"server":"cn","storyId":"act26side_level_act26side_04_end","groupId":"act26side","stageId":"act26side_04","title":"我曾舍命为你","storyCode":"HE-4","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act26side/level_act26side_04_end.txt","sourceHash":"b6d2f64eeeed323d98ba307d0f94a6a350f2347b0304fc8ee4b91686cb08f03b","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"圣像在火中轰然倒塌，众人怀疑的矛头指向在场的萨卡兹。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"火焰是会吞噬一切的魔鬼。\n再珍贵的物品，再受珍视的东西，只要一把火，一切都会就此消失。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_i03"},{"type":"narration","text":"杰拉尔德曾和我说，他们萨卡兹没有故乡，只有如影随形的战火。但他希望他们能有一个故乡，因此他们愿意跟随一位了不起的大人物。\n只是后来他失望了，所以选择离开。\n那时我不敢问他为什么失望。\n刚来到这里时，我们曾经满怀希望。\n这些年生活虽然辛苦，大家却仍感到幸福。\n但是现在......现在。\n现在他们要离开了。我忍不住会想，是不是因为这里的生活也同样已经令他失望？\n我呢？我又如何？\n现在我正......我正看着那些我珍视的东西，在我眼前燃烧。\n燃烧。\n消失殆尽。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g2_abandonsancturay"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"全都......没了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"好烫......！好大的火！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"烧起来了！圣堂......圣堂烧起来了！快！快打水来救火！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g8_outsidepath"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事？我看到有火光，发生什么事了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"莱蒙德！你怎么在这？你们不是，不是已经......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......现在不是说这个的时候！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"呃！对，对，你说得没错......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"你来得正好！圣堂着火了，快来帮忙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"圣堂？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"圣堂怎么会......怎么会忽然着火？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"我也想知道啊！往年这个季节也不是没有过火灾，但没一次烧得这么厉害，怎么偏偏就在这时候出岔子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，总之得先把火灭了！幸好烧起来的不是大伙住的地方......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先救火。等着，我去喊人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g2_abandonsancturay"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"水呢！咳......咳咳，还有没有水，再打点水来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，这火势压不住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你小心点，别吸这烟......我们得把大门关上，或许这样火就不会烧到外头来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"不行！你说什么混账话！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"这可是圣堂！圣像还在里头！门关上，咳，门关上难道火就能熄了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是这个意思！但现在太危险了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正确的判断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？你懂什么......你是什么人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉&艾伦戴尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"这两个孩子是......不对，你、你怎么能让孩子留在这么危险的地方？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"快离远点！这里不安全！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说得对，这里并不安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经吸入不少烟尘，如不立即采取相应防护措施，推测将很快出现头晕、重影等生理反应。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"那又怎么样？说了这么多，有没有点实际的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"我之前没见过你，你、你是萨科塔，你是拉特兰来的人吧！想点办法啊，那可是拉特兰的圣像！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"圣像并非我的任务中需要顾及的目标对象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"你在说什么......什么任务不任务的！现在是说这些的时候吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"你就不能用个什么，那种什么法术，把这该死的火给灭了？你要是根本什么都干不了，就站到一边去，别碍着我救火！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，我无法使用那样的源石技艺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想要尽量减少损失，需要更多人参与灭火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"我这就去喊人来帮忙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来帮忙。莱蒙德通知了我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少说废话，快点接一下水桶！我再去搬两桶来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好，好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里还有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们去安全的地方等待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是那个拉特兰的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这两个小孩怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不建议现在花时间讨论这个问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"桶给你，抬稳了，小子！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g2_abandonsancturay"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克莱芒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，别再往前走了，站住......克莱芒！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不建议你现在进入火场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放开、放开我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在没有采取充足的防护措施的情况下，这样做会非常危险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个小哥说得对！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这是干什么？你不要命了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我得去——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我得......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_i03"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，我刚刚有点头晕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道出了这事最不好受的就是你，但你别发昏，这可不是闹着玩的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的那些花......花总能再种。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"水桶又要空了，我再去打点水来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g2_abandonsancturay"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不能再往里走了！火太大，还有烟......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以留下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为避免烟雾中毒，建议你不要大声说话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说话是为了谁？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不用跟着我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我信不过你，我得盯着你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对，你听到什么声音没有？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"火焰熊熊燃烧，持铳的圣像发出不祥的嗡鸣。\n带着灼热温度的阴影投在莱蒙德身上，像是要审判这个竟敢走入萨科塔圣堂的萨卡兹，巨大的圣像在火海中倾倒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"后退！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"刺耳的碎裂声在耳畔响起。预想中的疼痛并未造访。\n执行者挡在萨卡兹身前，紧握着铳的手臂抬起。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有二次倒塌的风险，从这边走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的手臂......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，等等，你打碎了圣像？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有碎。如果不改变其倒下的方向，你会被砸中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可这是你们的圣像......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火势还在增大，这很奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"木制的长椅等内部陈设虽然易燃，但最初起火的位置有古怪，不能排除内部还有其他助燃物的可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么意思？你到底想说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g6_villagestreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（这里就是萨卡兹住的地方？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......就靠这么薄的墙板，根本抵御不了荒原上的寒风。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（呼......真的有点冷呢。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（耽搁得太久，天都已经黑了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗯？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（那边楼顶的是......火光？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（这种时候着火......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（看来费德里科那边也出了不小的问题哦。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......！有人来了！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g6_villagestreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"担忧的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们都去修道院里帮忙了，我们要不要也过去看看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"担忧的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯特凡诺对我们很好，就算我们已经要走了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愠怒的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要去你去，我才不去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愠怒的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是还有今天来的拉特兰人吗？让那些拉特兰人救他们去吧！我们没这个本事，就别去讨人嫌了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（哎呀，习惯性地躲起来了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（听起来像是闹矛盾了？我和奥伦刚到这里的时候，应该还不是这样的氛围......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"担忧的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别太生气了，蕾拉她......她也不是有意要那么说的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愠怒的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她不是故意的，那说明她心底里就这么想！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愠怒的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她怀疑我偷她的冬衣！我什么时候干过这种糟心事？往年这些都是由我负责，怎么之前她就没怀疑过？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"担忧的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们，唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愠怒的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她就是觉得我们碍眼！他们都是那么想的！他们从没把我们当成一伙的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愠怒的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯特凡诺不同意撇下我们回拉特兰，他们就恨上我们了！我算是看清楚了，只有我们自作多情，那些人从没把我们当成一伙的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"担忧的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愠怒的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰拉尔德老大当初说要走，我还有点犹豫，现在看来就该这么办！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愠怒的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走就走，谁怕？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"担忧的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......我们真的能走出这片荒野吗？探路的几个小伙子到现在都没回来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愠怒的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那也比继续待着强。我怕要是再有下回，我就忍不住要揍人了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g6_villagestreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真冷啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把自己关在房间里久了，都不知道外面的夜晚这么冷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是重大失职，薇尔丽芙恐怕要扣我的工资了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，要是真被扣了，下下个月就不给莫斯提马买那个六层闪光水果蛋糕，自己做一个省省钱好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没时间再耽搁了呢......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——找到你了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g3_abandonsancturay_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"终于灭了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"东西基本都烧没了，不过还好，至少没烧到下面的屋子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"还好？哪里好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"圣像都烧成这样了，还有花圃......呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人没事就是好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，莱蒙德，你们那边还好吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还行。死不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你小子命硬，还真敢就这么往里冲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看杰拉尔德回头知道了不揍你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......别告诉杰拉尔德老大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在知道怕了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"出了这么大的事，主教阁下怎么还没来，有人通知主教阁下了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天就先这样吧，也没其他办法，先通知主教阁下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都当心点，别再出这样的意外......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉&艾伦戴尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大哥哥！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是意外。初步推测有人蓄意纵火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特兰的小子，这话可不能乱说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能......谁会想烧圣堂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你这么说有什么根据？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火势不正常，有其他助燃物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......就这个？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已经足够得出结论。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这家伙——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下，莱蒙德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么？你也想说是有人故意放火？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"我......不确定。但是之前......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"之前我去喊人，这地方平常来的人不多，特别是、特别是你们萨卡兹更不怎么来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"但我却在附近碰到了你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等会，你这话是什么意思？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费尔南，别打断！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让他继续说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我没别的意思。我就是想问问......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"莱蒙德，你怎么会恰好出现在这？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g11_monasterycorridor_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这就是你想让我看的吗，杰拉尔德？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你我在场，大家都有所顾忌，听不到多少真心话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是我们的现状，斯特凡诺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白，我一直都明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是怪谁。谁都没错。大伙只是想好好过日子，安安稳稳的，只是现状如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹......注定漂泊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我说过，这里会是你们的家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是说过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也曾说，你想试着让那些孩子，在这里扎下你们的根。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许是我错了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说的，谁都没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......斯特凡诺，你最近心事重重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在计划什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者我该问，这场火......和你有关系吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
